etry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[137.92185545,34.83215165]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"parks_playgrounds","name":"森第一公園","category":"nature","address":"周智郡森町","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"22461","municipality_pref":"静岡県","municipality_name":"森町","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[137.92694299,34.83452093]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"parks_playgrounds","name":"北見公園","category":"nature","address":"周智郡森町","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"22461","municipality_pref":"静岡県","municipality_name":"森町","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[137.9235022,34.82895637]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"tourism_resources","name":"葛布滝","category":"nature","address":"河川景観 / 滝","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"22461","municipality_pref":"静岡県","municipality_name":"森町","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid","resource_code":"610"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[137.9176483154297,34.88471984863281]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"layer_id":"tourism_resources","name":"太田川上流","category":"nature","address":"河川景観 / 峡谷・渓谷","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"22461","municipality_pref":"静岡県","municipality_name":"森町","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid","resource_code":"601"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[137.94906616210938,34.90505599975586]}}],"display_comment_original":"森町周辺には、近世村の記憶として森町村、下河原新田、中河原新田などの旧村名が見える。 この地域には寺社や信仰の場、城跡や陣屋跡、史跡や遺跡に関わる場所が見え、天方城跡、飯田城跡、坂田北遺跡のような地点が探索の入口になる。 現地では史跡説明板、森町村、下河原新田ゆかりの旧境石標や村の歴史案内板が手がかりになりそうだ。さらに田・新田・用水の地名が多く、土地改良碑や用水記念碑が見つかる可能性がある。水辺の暮らしや堤防整備の歴史を示す案内板に加え、治水碑や河川改修の記念碑が狙い目になる。","story_enrichment":{"samurai_priority_people":[],"notable_people":["森の石松","一木清直","鈴木藤三郎","中村真一郎","松井孝典"],"honorary_citizens":[],"tourism_landmarks":["天方城","小国神社","天宮神社","山名神社","大洞院","蓮華寺","崇信寺","秋葉街道 森宿"],"specialties":["次郎柿（治郎柿）","森山焼（陶器）"],"food_culture":[],"historical_domains":[],"heian_place_names":[],"japan_search_support":["新釈講談文庫 [1] (森の石松) https://jpsearch.go.jp/item/dignl-1658769","人間清水次郎長 https://jpsearch.go.jp/item/dignl-3449126","週刊新潮 42(24)(2109);1997・6・26 https://jpsearch.go.jp/item/dignl-3378979"],"enrichment_sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%A3%AE%E7%94%BA_%28%E9%9D%99%E5%B2%A1%E7%9C%8C%29","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11539086","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q1149636","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11649243","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q1344451","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11529091","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q3482767","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q2654022","https://jpsearch.go.jp/csearch/jps-cross?csid=jps-cross&keyword=%E6%A3%AE%E3%81%AE%E7%9F%B3%E6%9D%BE&keyword=%E6%A3%AE%E7%94%BA"],"enrichment_errors":[],"wikipedia_title":"森町 (静岡県)","wikipedia_revision_id":"110719419","wikidata_qid":"Q1345571","wikipedia_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%A3%AE%E7%94%BA_%28%E9%9D%99%E5%B2%A1%E7%9C%8C%29","japan_search_query_url":"https://jpsearch.go.jp/csearch/jps-cross?csid=jps-cross&keyword=%E6%A3%AE%E3%81%AE%E7%9F%B3%E6%9D%BE&keyword=%E6%A3%AE%E7%94%BA","status":"wikipedia_ok"}}